    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Forge-Line Stabilizer.</strong> You can tune whole lines of fortifications, roads, and depots so they share the load of stress.</p><ul><li>When your faction maintains a continuous line of <strong>fortified hexes, strongpoints, or infrastructure nodes</strong> that you have personally helped reinforce, their <strong>upkeep costs</strong> (in Economy OP or equivalent) are reduced by a small amount, or their <strong>chance of catastrophic failure</strong> is reduced (GM decides the exact numbers.)</li><li>This effect is active as long as you’re part of the faction and regularly tending the network.</li></ul><p>In fiction, your work shows up as smart bracing, shared load paths, firebreaks, and subtle rituals that let places hold each other up.</p>",
